<string name="app_name">ModKit</string><string name="app_subtitle">Android application and game analysis · APK-set · DEX · Native · Unity/IL2CPP</string><string name="target_unknown">Target · UNKNOWN</string><string name="target_label">Target</string><string name="how_it_works">How it works</string><string name="pipeline_title">ModKit pipeline</string><string name="pipeline_message">1. Choose an installed app/game or a local APK. Installed Scanner collects base + splits, determines the Target Profile, and checks DEX/native/IL2CPP.\n\n2. For regular apps, Application Discovery analyzes auth/session, entitlement, storage, network, crypto, WebView, deep links and other trust boundaries. Presence of a surface is not treated as a vulnerability.\n\n3. Games additionally get Gameplay Discovery and IL2CPP/Rodroid evidence.\n\n4. Probe/Menu allow only fail-closed verified bindings.\n\n5. APK-set modifies only the owning split and re-signs the whole set with one local AndroidKeyStore key.\n\nProcessing is local; NOT_FOUND_LOCAL only means evidence was not found in the scanned local artifacts.</string>
